<view class="page safety-page">
  <view class="section"><view class="section__head"><text class="section__title">实名认证</text><text class="tag {{verified ? 'tag--success' : ''}}">{{verified ? '已完成' : '未认证'}}</text></view><text class="caption">首次履约前需要完成实名认证，未满18周岁不可下单。</text><button wx:if="{{!verified}}" class="btn btn--small verify-button" bindtap="openVerification">去认证</button></view>
  <view class="section"><view class="section__head"><text class="section__title">紧急联系人</text><text wx:if="{{saved}}" class="tag tag--success">已设置</text></view><text class="caption">请填写你信任的人。遇到履约安全问题时，平台可按安全流程协助联系。</text>
    <text class="field-label">姓名</text><input class="field" value="{{name}}" bindinput="editName" maxlength="20" placeholder="请输入联系人姓名" aria-label="紧急联系人姓名" />
    <text class="field-label">关系</text><picker range="{{relationOptions}}" bindchange="chooseRelation"><view class="relation-button"><text>{{relation}}</text><view class="control-chevron control-chevron--down" aria-hidden="true"></view></view></picker>
    <text class="field-label">手机号</text><input class="field" type="number" value="{{phone}}" bindinput="editPhone" maxlength="11" placeholder="请输入联系人手机号" aria-label="紧急联系人手机号" />
    <text wx:if="{{error}}" class="field-error">{{error}}</text><button class="btn btn--primary save-button" bindtap="saveContact">{{saved ? '保存修改' : '保存联系人'}}</button>
  </view>
  <view class="notice">当前为本地演示版，联系人仅保存在本机小程序缓存中。正式上线前需接入服务端与安全工单流程。</view>
</view>
